out={'schema':'riverstone.r10.actual_water_branches_network.v1','status':'CONDITIONAL_PROPOSED_BRANCH_ACCESS_RUNTIME_AND_SUPPLY_PENDING','sources':{str(p.relative_to(ROOT)):sha(p) for p in [W/'routes.json',W/'selected_sites.json',O/'observed_graph.json',O/'observed_residential_access_ledger.json']},'actual_draw_candidates':candidates,'before':stats(base,weights),'after':stats(after,weights),'benefited_residential_modules':int(benefit.sum()),'benefited_assumed_residential_area_share_midpoint':float(weights[benefit].sum()/weights.sum()),'benefited_6000_area_allocation_midpoint':float(6000*weights[benefit].sum()/weights.sum()),'low_area_scenario':{'before':stats(base,lo),'after':stats(after,lo),'benefited_6000_area_allocation':float(6000*lo[benefit].sum()/lo.sum())},'high_area_scenario':{'before':stats(base,hi),'after':stats(after,hi),'benefited_6000_area_allocation':float(6000*hi[benefit].sum()/hi.sum())},'service_interfaces':services,'limits':['Network20mm interpolated observed ground graph; arbitrary joins still analytical except separately tested turns.','Actual new branch length is included up to queue endpoint; pending physical replay not called proven.','Residential station-to-house gap remains unproved and is not added as a straight-line route.','Existing market baseline ends at its road station; unproved9.86m fountain last-mile is not invented.','6000 scenario distributes all residents uniformly by assumed residential net floor area; no actual household counts or institutional population inferred.','No potable quality, operational source head, storage capacity or flow is established.']}
